https://github.com/elizaOS/agent-twitter-client

1. Create Twitter Developer Account - https://developer.twitter.com/en/portal/dashboard
2. Create Twitter "Project"
3. Add "YourPlace" as an App under the Project
4. Navigate to "Keys and Tokens" and generate the following:
    - API Key
    - API Secret Key
    - Access Token
    - Access Token Secret
5. Add Access Token & it's secret to the user environment variables
    * X_Access_Token
    * X_Access_Token_Secret
6. Authenticate using https://github.com/dghubble/oauth1
